WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.777
Step three. Get test tokens.

2
00:00:02.777 --> 00:00:16.874
A brand new account needs a little test X L M to pay network fees. Tap Get test X L M.

3
00:00:16.874 --> 00:00:24.195
Next, tap Get test U S D C. The faucet gives you fifty thousand test tokens, once an hour.

4
00:00:24.195 --> 00:00:29.959
Albedo shows the transaction, and the network says testnet. Confirm to sign it.

5
00:00:29.959 --> 00:00:36.299
Done. Your balance updates, and every action links to its transaction on the testnet explorer.

